flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1502825Z ^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1503542Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1504659Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1505125Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1505528Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1506853Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1507473Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1507849Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1508582Z    if you are ready to continue.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1508923Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1509779Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1510734Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1512160Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1512835Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1513165Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1513515Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1514044Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1514308Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1514775Z    can use Nix.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1514943Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1515067Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1515275Z 
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1515611Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1516133Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
