flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1532644Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1533617Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1544549Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
flake	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-10T17:20:32.1545417Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
